    <updated>2026-07-30T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Akshat Lakhiwal, Che-Wei Liu, Hillol Bala, Hung-Yue Suen</name>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;b&gt;Information Systems Research&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br&gt;AI-generated scores, they anchored on those scores and discounted their own judgment, even though the scores could not distinguish honest from deceptive individuals. Transparency can thus improve the evaluation experience, but its benefits depend on protecting, rather than replacing, human judgment.</content>
