  <entry>
    <id>https://doi.org/10.1287/mksc.2022.0437</id>
    <title>Does Premium Version Adoption in mHealth Improve User Engagement and Health-Related Outcomes?</title>
    <updated>2026-08-06T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Yikun Jiang, Kosuke Uetake, Nathan Yang</name>
